    <item>
      <title>Security release for psqlodbc</title>
      <link>https://www.postgresql.org/about/news/security-release-for-psqlodbc-3431/</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The PostgreSQL ODBC project has released version 18.00.0006 to fix multiple security issues see the &lt;a href="https://github.com/postgresql-interfaces/psqlodbc/blob/main/Changelog.md"&gt;Changelog&lt;/a&gt; for details&lt;/p&gt;</description>
